# Module: Institution Management

## Scope

Tenant provisioning, academic years/terms, grades, classes, sections, subjects, staff profiles.

## Key Entities

`Tenant`, `TenantSettings`, `AcademicYear`, `Term`, `Grade`, `Class`, `Section`, `Subject`, `ClassSubject`, `Staff`

## Permissions

```
institution.tenant.create        # super-admin only
institution.tenant.manage
institution.academic-years.manage
institution.classes.manage
institution.subjects.manage
institution.staff.manage
institution.staff.fields.manage
institution.staff.documents.manage
```

Student documents: `students.documents.manage` (student owner validation activates in Sprint 4).

## Commands (MVP)

| Implemented | Path |
|-------------|------|
| `CreateTenantCommand` | `Application/Commands/Tenants/CreateTenant/` |
| `CreateAcademicYearCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateAcademicYear/` |
| `SetCurrentAcademicYearCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/SetCurrentAcademicYear/` |
| `ListAcademicYearsQuery` | `Application/Queries/Institution/ListAcademicYears/` |
| `CreateGradeCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateGrade/` |
| `CreateClassCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateClass/` |
| `CreateSectionCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateSection/` |
| `CreateStaffCommand`, `UpdateStaffCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateStaff/`, `UpdateStaff/` |
| `LinkStaffToUserCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/LinkStaffToUser/` |
| `CreateCustomFieldDefinitionCommand`, `UpdateCustomFieldDefinitionCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/CreateCustomFieldDefinition/` |
| `UploadStaffDocumentCommand`, `DeleteStaffDocumentCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/UploadProfileDocument/`, `DeleteProfileDocument/` |
| `UploadStudentDocumentCommand` | `Application/Commands/Institution/UploadProfileDocument/` (requires Student entity) |
| `ListGradesQuery`, `ListClassesQuery`, `ListStaffQuery`, `GetStaffByIdQuery` | `Application/Queries/Institution/` |

- `SuspendTenantCommand`, `ActivateTenantCommand` (not yet)
- `AssignClassTeacherCommand`, `CreateSubjectCommand`, `AssignSubjectToClassCommand`

## Validation Rules

- Academic year dates must not overlap within tenant
- Only one `IsCurrent = true` academic year per tenant
- Class capacity must be positive integer
- Class teacher must be active staff in same tenant

## Events

- `TenantCreatedIntegrationEvent` → seed defaults (roles, CoA stub)
- `AcademicYearChangedIntegrationEvent`

## Hierarchy

```
Tenant → AcademicYear → Grade → Class → Section
                              ↘ Subject (via ClassSubject)
```

## Dependencies

- Identity module for `User` linking on staff
- RBAC for tenant admin role seeding on provisioning
